[b]CSS v1.0.0-beta.7[/b]

This update adds support for outfits that combine sheer fabric with solid details. Unholy Genessa is the first experiment using it.

[list]
[*]Separate color controls for fabric overlays and the material underneath.
[*]Fabric overlays return after temporary game effects finish.
[*]Better lighting for translucent materials in the CSS preview.
[*]Stowed weapons follow the selected appearance's socket adjustments.
[*]Improved handling of Gragu's helmet when switching appearances.
[/list]

Close the game, extract the ZIP into [b]MortalShell2/Binaries/Win64/ue4ss/Mods/[/b] and overwrite. Keep your [b]CustomShellSystem/state/[/b] folder.

If something looks wrong, send a screenshot and your CSS.log. Feedback is welcome.
